{% set currentUser = craft.app.user.identity %}

<h2>Users</h2>

<p class="hint">
	Seeded state: public registration on (no email verification), and all three
	protections enabled &mdash; registration, login, forgot password. Each form fails
	with a 400 when submitted without a solved widget. Currently signed in:
	<strong>{{ currentUser ? currentUser.username : 'nobody' }}</strong>.
	Password-reset emails land in Mailpit.
</p>

<ol class="hint">
	<li>Per form: solve and submit &mdash; the action succeeds; then submit without touching the widget &mdash; 400 &ldquo;Altcha verification failed&rdquo;.</li>
	<li>Registration creates an active user (verification is off), so you can log straight in with it afterwards.</li>
	<li>The control panel login at <a href="/admin">/admin</a> carries no widget and must keep working regardless &mdash; the integration only guards site requests.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Register</h3>
<form method="post">
	{{ csrfInput() }}
	{{ actionInput('users/save-user') }}
	{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=users') }}

	<label for="reg-username">Username</label>
	<input id="reg-username" name="username" type="text" value="smoke{{ random(1000, 9999) }}">

	<label for="reg-email">Email</label>
	<input id="reg-email" name="email" type="email" value="smoke{{ random(1000, 9999) }}@lab.test">

	<label for="reg-password">Password</label>
	<input id="reg-password" name="password" type="password" value="password">

	{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

	<p><button type="submit">Register</button></p>
</form>

<h3>Log in</h3>
<form method="post">
	{{ csrfInput() }}
	{{ actionInput('users/login') }}
	{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=users') }}

	<label for="login-name">Username or email</label>
	<input id="login-name" name="loginName" type="text" value="editor@lab.test">

	<label for="login-password">Password</label>
	<input id="login-password" name="password" type="password" value="password">

	{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

	<p><button type="submit">Log in</button></p>
</form>

<h3>Forgot password</h3>
<form method="post">
	{{ csrfInput() }}
	{{ actionInput('users/send-password-reset-email') }}
	{{ redirectInput('lab-test?page=users') }}

	<label for="forgot-name">Username or email</label>
	<input id="forgot-name" name="loginName" type="text" value="editor@lab.test">

	{{ craft.altcha.renderWidget() }}

	<p><button type="submit">Send reset email</button></p>
</form>
